  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.6: Flagship robustness and API consistency upgrade:\n- API consistency: Aligned LookupRowIdUint/LookupRowIdBytes with Lookup* family soft-fail convention (returns 0 after Dispose, eliminating unreachable dead-code branch).\n- Resource leak prevention: Hardened FromPath mmap lifecycle with nested try/catch layers to guarantee deterministic disposal of FileStream/MemoryMappedFile on empty (0-byte) or corrupted files (closing CA2000 leak windows).\n- Early validation: Added explicit zero-byte empty file check with descriptive QzdbException.\n- Code quality: Clean Roslyn analysis under strictest AnalysisMode=All with documented suppressions for safe deferred-disposal patterns; modernized RequireSnapshot using ObjectDisposedException.ThrowIf.",
